1. Removed the direct assignment to `trpc` constant which was causing the error
2. Used proper module mocking pattern with `jest.mock`
3. Moved the mocks outside the component
4. Removed unnecessary mock variable declarations
5. Kept the component rendering logic clean and simple

This should resolve the "Assignment to constant variable" error while still providing the necessary mocked functionality for the component to render properly.

